          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach {{COACH_NAME}} for soulful, evidence-minded wellness coaching in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Join a cohort, take the short diagnostic, and begin small daily shifts.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--muted:#6b6b6b;--accent:#2b6cb0;--soft:#eef6fb;--radius:12px;--max:980px}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;line-height:1.5;color:#111;background:var(--bg);margin:0}\\n    .container{max-width:var(--max);margin:48px auto;padding:40px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:36px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--soft),#fff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:20px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:36px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px;color:#0b3a57}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:20px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:var(--soft);color:var(--accent);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}\\n    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #eef2f5;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(14,30,37,0.04)}\\n    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    input,textarea,select{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6eef6;font-size:15px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .secondary{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6eef6;color:var(--accent)}\\n    footer{margin-top:40px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .links{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    .summary{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media (max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.container{padding:20px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{COACH_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Pathways</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Invest</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Reach Out</div>\\n        <h1>A gentle space to ask for guidance and next steps</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I meet small, consistent shifts with soulful curiosity. If you\\u2019re ready to explore a cohort experience, start with the short diagnostic and we\\u2019ll map a plan of micro-habits tailored to your life.\\n        </p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Quick help</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"summary\\\">Prefer a direct line? Call or email to schedule a 15-minute clarity call. For cohort sign-up, use the Book page and choose a Pathway. If you want the free lead magnet and diagnostic, mention it here and I\\u2019ll send the guide.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email {{EMAIL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">How this connects to the programs</h3>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li><strong>Hero Worksheet:</strong> the quick diagnostic used at enrollment — find it on the Home page or ask for the PDF.</li>\\n            <li><strong>Path Map:</strong> we co-create a plan that folds in micro-habits, paced for cohort rhythms.</li>\\n            <li><strong>Pricing preview:</strong> tiers and scholarships are on the Invest page; payment plans are available for cohorts.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Contact Form</h3>\\n          <form action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" onsubmit=\\\"alert('Thank you — we will follow up by email within 48 hours.');return false;\\\">\\n            <input name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your full name\\\" required />\\n            <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" required />\\n            <input name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"Phone (optional)\\\" />\\n            <select name=\\\"interest\\\" aria-label=\\\"Area of interest\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"diagnostic\\\">Short Diagnostic</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"cohort\\\">Cohort Program</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"one-on-one\\\">Private Coaching</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"lead-magnet\\\">Lead Magnet & Guide</option>\\n            </select>\\n            <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell me briefly what you want to shift or ask about...\\\"></textarea>\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n              <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;\\\">Reserve time</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fbff,#fff);border:1px solid #ecf6ff\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Need a quick self-check?</div>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">Find the diagnostic on the Home page under \\\"Start\\\" or request it here. The diagnostic helps us set a short-term plan and 3 micro-habits you can use within a week.</p>\\n          <a href=\\\"index.html#diagnostic\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:inline-block\\\">Open diagnostic</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"links\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Privacy</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"terms.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Terms</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Project Notes\\\\n\\\\nThis chunk contains the Contact page and project README for the wellness coach site (zen_minimal). Replace placeholders across files before publishing.\\\\n\\\\nFiles in this bundle:\\\\n- contact.html  — clean, minimal contact & intake form (static).\\\\n- README.md     — this file.\\\\n\\\\nPlaceholders to replace:\\\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\\\n- {{PHONE}}\\\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\\n- {{COACH_NAME}}\\\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\\\n- {{CITY}}\\\\n- {{STATE}}\\\\n\\\\nDesign notes:\\\\n- Layout family: zen_minimal — lots of white space, calm palette, minimal components.\\\\n- Voice family: spiritual_teacher — warm, reflective, outcome-oriented language.\\\\n- Program model: cohort — references to cohort pathways and cohort-friendly scheduling appear throughout.\\\\n\\\\nRequired sections linkage:\\\\n- This contact page references the required sections (hero, diagnostic, plan, micro_habits, pricing, cta) that appear on the Home and other pages: it links to index.html#diagnostic, highlights the plan & micro-habits, and offers direct CTAs to book and to call/email.\\\\n\\\\nAccessibility & behavior:\\\\n- The contact form is static and uses a simple onsubmit alert to simulate a submission (no external services).\\\\n- Telephone and mailto links use placeholders so they work once replaced.\\\\n\\\\nHow to preview locally:\\\\n- Drop this file into the site folder alongside the other HTML pages and open contact.html in a browser.\\\\n- Ensure assets (svg files) and other pages exist in the same folder structure.\\\\n\\\\nNotes for final build:\\\\n- Replace placeholders with real values.\\\\n- Hook the form to your email provider or back-end endpoint, and remove the onsubmit stub.\\\\n- Add the SVG assets: assets/img/hero.svg, assets/img/avatar.svg, assets/img/pattern.svg (unique files per project).\\\\n\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
